  <item>
    <title>Minneapolis: data center moratorium — Expired</title>
    <link>https://aigridwatch.com/communities/minneapolis-mn</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">mora-minneapolis-mn</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description>6-month moratorium on data centers &gt;350,000 sq ft, 8-5. Downtown core exempt. Zoning ordinance updates and environmental impact report due during the pause. No extension passed: the council&#x27;s replacement ordinance (7-6) was vetoed by the mayor and the override failed on Nov 20, so the moratorium lapses Nov 21, 2026 with no new rules in place. Regulations return to a Dec 14 planning hearing and a Dec 17 council vote</description>
  </item>
